        numbers were always whole-school (STAR headline + reading by time at bina), so they now
        read that way: stat row → "the longer they stay" chart → level spotlights → one
        "find your child's level" table. Mint band so it doesn't blend into the dark level cards
        above. All figures from student-results.json; never typed here. */}
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
      {/* Same heading style as the "Learning that fits your child" group title (Akis, 2026-11-23). */}
